<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:50:55.640Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>SET TEXTMERGE DELIMITERS Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET TEXTMERGE DELIMITERS command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET TEXTMERGE DELIMITERS Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">指定用于标记在文本合并输出中进行求值的表达式的分隔符。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET TEXTMERGE DELIMITERS [TO [&lt;cLeftDelimiter&gt; [, &lt;cRightDelimiter&gt;]]]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">TO &lt;cLeftDelimiter&gt; [, &lt;cRightDelimiter&gt;]<tab />用于标记表达式开始和结束的字符。当仅指定左分隔符时，该字符也将用作右分隔符。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">默认分隔符为 &lt;&lt; 和 &gt;&gt;。当 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Command_SET_TEXTMERGE">SET TEXTMERGE</link> 设置为 ON 时，这些分隔符会在 \ 和 \\ 命令以及 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="TEXT-Command-(FoxPro)">TEXT ... ENDTEXT</link> 命令中使用。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">示例</para>
    <para styleclass="Code Example">SET TEXTMERGE ON<br/>SET TEXTMERGE DELIMITERS TO &quot;{&quot;, &quot;}&quot;<br/>TEXT<br/>今天是 {DATE()}<br/>ENDTEXT</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="Command_SET_TEXTMERGE">SET TEXTMERGE</link>、<link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="TEXT-Command-(FoxPro)">TEXT ... ENDTEXT</link>、<link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_VFP_Functions_SetTextMergeDelimiters.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetTextMergeDelimiters()</link></para>
  </body>
